User reports many unavailable: Removal trial budget exhausted messages on real diffs. Current default MaxTrials=8 per map is too low. Increase default to a practical bounded value covering typical large changed-embed batches (initial decision 256 per map), preserve explicit caller override and existing body/raw-byte/entry/cancellation safeguards. Regression must measure >8 distinct embedded entries with default options without budget exhaustion, and still verify low explicit overrides. Verify actual v205/v206 changed entries with available fixture and record runtime. Implement now as explicit follow-up requested during batch.